coid.natvis is referenced directly by comm.vcxproj, comm_static.vcxproj and
comm_test.vcxproj as a <Natvis Include=...> item, so Visual Studio loads it
automatically when debugging those projects and nothing has to be copied.

To use it from a project that does not reference it, either add the same item
there, or copy the file into
    %USERPROFILE%\Documents\Visual Studio 2022\Visualizers\nwhich applies to every solution you debug.

usertype.dat and autoexp.dat are for Visual Studio 2010 and are kept only for
reference; comm requires C++20 and so a much newer toolset.
